Place your trained YOLO classification weights here as "best.pt".

Expected path: raspberry_pi/models/best.pt
The model must be a classification model (main.py reads results[0].probs.top1),
with drowsy class names among: drowsy, sleepy, closed.

This .gitkeep file only exists so the empty models/ folder is tracked by git.
You can delete it once best.pt is in place.